WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.440
Two roots this week, and both are about sight.

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:04.810
One means see.

00:00:04.810 --> 00:00:06.310
One means look.

00:00:06.310 --> 00:00:09.700
Then words that sound the same but are spelled differently.

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:12.050
A spell checker will not catch them.

00:00:12.050 --> 00:00:16.120
In the spyglass game, find the root first, then the meaning.
